Breast Cancer Prediction Using Machine Learning

This is one of my beginner Machine Learning projects, created while learning how ML can be applied to healthcare-related problems.

The project uses a breast cancer dataset containing 569 samples and 30 numerical features related to cell characteristics, with the target being Malignant or Benign diagnosis.

The goal of this project is to learn the basic ML workflow, including data exploration, preprocessing, feature selection, model training, prediction, and performance evaluation.

Technologies: Python • Pandas • NumPy • Scikit-learn • Matplotlib
